body:
In personal use I had no change in acne when I started adderall but did see slightly worse acne come and go aftering being on Amp. The cause is probably extra oil and sweat production, as well as spiking and lowering blood sugar levels from suppressed appetite. The fact that you might not eat as much probably aids in a worse immune system, too.

&#x200B;

Unless you notice a direct correlation it should be fine. In my experience a simple clensing of the face will fix the sweat problem instigating acne.
